[00:52.135]Child
[00:58.316]Weep not for the past
[01:08.418]What’s come has come
[01:12.880]What’s gone has gone
[01:16.886]You must stand
[01:24.879]
[01:26.295]Child
[01:31.463]Let tears fall no more
[01:41.620]He’s no longer here
[01:46.380]And neither is home
[01:49.117]
[01:58.750]Among countless vows
[02:06.544]I’ll chase the farthest one
[02:15.361]Perhaps
[02:26.413]Fleeting is shorter than fleeting itself
[02:31.069]
[02:31.131]Child
[02:38.994]Let it all out
[02:46.462]When you’ve sung til the color burns out the sky
[02:54.846]You’ll understand that a trickle lasts a long time
[03:01.363]
[03:02.722]Child
[03:07.855]Trade the end for a beginning
[03:16.933]Eternity is but a blink of an eye
[03:25.069]Pain is only this moment
[03:30.961]
[03:33.195]Among countless vows
[03:39.878]I’ll chase the farthest one
[03:47.760]Perhaps
[03:49.014]Fleeting is shorter than fleeting itself
[04:01.597]
[04:03.809]The past like a dream
[04:10.734]We set out before dawn
[04:18.637]Which look, which day
[04:26.916]Will be the last look?
[05:49.690]
